{"time": 1756181733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322983686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1103687391]\"也许...你是对的。\"她开口，\"不过我拒绝。\""}
{"time": 1756181770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712318846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且我现在就是人类...用不着你,倒是你...怎么混进来的，不怕我举报你吗”"}
{"time": 1756181789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963073628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的右手再次动了起来，片下小腿上的一层皮肉，痛感直接冲上天灵盖"}
{"time": 1756181818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858014203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=712318846]背后的门不知何时关上，\"你都来了这里，觉得自己能走掉吗？\""}
{"time": 1756181851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734556073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...你想干什么”"}
