{"time": 1756214413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301960025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1756214528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554195659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1304574674]“要剥皮的话...怎么看都只能用这种刀片吧？”她皱了皱眉，“大点的刀是砍断切开用的。”"}
{"time": 1756214753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543292076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你给青蛙或者鱼剥过皮吗”"}
{"time": 1756214926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766047062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在腿根……环着拉一圈……然后从腿根经由膝盖到脚背……划一刀……就可以整块扯下来了”*说着短痛的计划，但是每个词都在颤抖"}
