{"time": 1756215276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421529434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1766047062]“呃...你确定这样不会更痛吗？”她有些无语，“一片一片，后面就会麻木的”"}
{"time": 1756215527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084647932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=60562036]“当然，要表现得嚣张一些...不过和平常差别不能太大，就是这样。”她捧着你的脸，“表现的好的话，我可以奖励小粉丝一个吻哦？”"}
{"time": 1756215566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786652396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一定会好好表现的”"}
{"time": 1756215581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493903204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1421529434]“不…要，四百刀……听起来就…好恐怖。这个只要……两下就可以了……”*或许有的选听起来总是好的"}
{"time": 1756215729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475418504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=786652396]\"最重要的是...不要让其他人喜欢上你，要很嫌恶哦?\"她笑了笑，\"只能为我而活，喜欢也只能给我。\""}
{"time": 1756215745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623467481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“吉尔内里莎，听见没，快给我开门”"}
{"time": 1756215776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797364915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1493903204]\"你确定要开个口子，亲手撕掉皮肤吗？\"她皱着眉，\"听上去就不靠谱。\""}
{"time": 1756215780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754726385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1475418504]（这么变态啊）"}
{"time": 1756215848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167807191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1475418504]“嗯...毕竟，里谢娜姐姐就是我的全部呢...”"}
{"time": 1756215941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839628656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=623467481]\"呵呵...小丫头片子。\"她伸出手敲了敲你的脑袋，\"记得带着里榭娜的音响。\"里榭娜把一只白色的音响递给了你。"}
{"time": 1756215963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215018978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1797364915]“我……”*拿着刀，颤抖着贴在自己腿根，眼泪止不住往下滴“早知道要自己动手……用刀给自己去皮，我就……不要……”"}
{"time": 1756216099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124813014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢里谢娜姐姐”笑着接过音箱，然后生气的看着吉尔内丽莎“谁让你碰我头了，只有里榭娜姐姐才能摸，哼”瞪她"}
