{"time": 1756235691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999901202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=863052898]四周的场景逐渐变换...黑暗被白色的光笼罩，下一瞬间，你回到了顶层的树冠中"}
{"time": 1756235753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286138766", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*支撑不住，昏了过去"}
