{"time": 1756235810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505126367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实是哭累了）"}
{"time": 1756235814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535079285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "身体完好无损，除了精神有些过度疲劳，没有其他变化，当然，心脏旁边有个热源。此外...一边的腿毫无感觉"}
{"time": 1756235817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488149488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（心因的）"}
{"time": 1756235828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116395834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(顺手把你，大半劳损弄好了)"}
{"time": 1756235986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556093239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=103549351]你被她夹着一路到了雷维翁的驻地"}
{"time": 1756236015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314992109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜呜.....”可恶的莉夏，你给我等着"}
{"time": 1756236081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287953066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*试着站起来，但怎么都觉得不协调。右腿像消失了一样感觉不到地面，只要不低着头就会摔倒。但总觉得……摔就摔了，要不干脆……睡一觉"}
{"time": 1756236087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110880811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随后她把你反锁在房间，也没解开绳子，立刻出去了。"}
{"time": 1756236123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204705879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打滚，试图把头发上的音箱给蹭下来"}
{"time": 1756236196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320626729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=287953066]顶层鲜少有人到访，这里空空荡荡的"}
{"time": 1756236304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "185946210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1204705879]试试敏捷"}
{"time": 1756236315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639225482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1"}
{"time": 1756236315, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1639225482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫露]演奏出: 1D20+1={14}+1=15"}
{"time": 1756236324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247328169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“到最后……除了逞能以外……”*坐在角落里，抱着失去知觉的腿和失去了许多的自己，像死人一样靠在书架上“什么都……做不到……”"}
{"time": 1756236366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365028701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1639225482]发箍被蹭在地上，变回了白色的音响"}
{"time": 1756236511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832488156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=247328169]风拂过树叶发出沙沙声，你感觉很困倦..."}
{"time": 1756236573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747623400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=365028701]里榭娜的声音传出，\"呃...怎么弄成这样?\""}
{"time": 1756236743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79331624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1832488156]*向一侧倒在地上，看上去和死人也没什么区别，只剩很稳定的呼吸"}
