{"time": 1756311272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300158655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876646891]\"...别怕，小诺诺。\"她看着你，\"只是在骑士团...没有问题的。\"随后她拿出了一根银白色的长杖，上面流动着水纹，\"守护...请给我...祓除的力量。\"温和的水笼罩在你四周，随后融入你的皮肤，顿时身体舒服了很多，也不再想那个谁和那个谁的事情了"}
{"time": 1756311293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424495647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1600640525](你知道括号是什么意思吗，是没打完，待续，哈哈)"}
{"time": 1756311353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391956972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢蜜姆姐姐，我感觉好多了...”"}
{"time": 1756311520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839889006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“接下来还需要做什么吗...”"}
{"time": 1756311649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886475400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不需要了，明天进学院，进学院的生命科看一看。\"她说完退开，\"我先走啦，莉夏。\"莉夏点点头，目送她离开"}
{"time": 1756311714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725590088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父..为什么我会被找上”"}
{"time": 1756312089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689619755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她摇摇头，\"这个问题的答案，你要自己去寻找?不过..你心里应该也有答案了吧？\""}
{"time": 1756312118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072440790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会是因为....我的过去吧”"}
{"time": 1756312236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791955605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么..明明好不容易才成为人类的...她们好坏”坐在床上，把头埋在膝盖"}
