{"time": 1756350013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948186197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "关键的原料是一种称为穿山甲的鳞粉的东西"}
