{"time": 1756360956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865122118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（主要我现在进不去中环了）"}
{"time": 1756361057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978996222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，师父，西莉斯姐姐怎么这么调皮，这个时候还在和我玩捉迷藏呢，我会赢的...好了好了露露不用担心我了，我怎么会出事呢”"}
{"time": 1756361093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299098673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骑士团是不是没地图了）"}
{"time": 1756361103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259537793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我印象里好像就这几个了）"}
{"time": 1756361155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934466593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没吧)"}
{"time": 1756361173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507967873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没吧的意思是没地图了，还是没找完）"}
{"time": 1756361235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143676687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没地图)"}
{"time": 1756361241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532266750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1756361531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248497611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过，我的剑都给露露了，露露的剑也借我用一下吧”把闪烁之光拿过来，然后不顾身上的血，直接出门“感觉大家时时刻刻都在我的身边呢”心情好像也变好了“谢谢大家，我肯定很快就能找到西莉斯姐姐的”"}
{"time": 1756361661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306837084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉斯姐姐你在哪啊，别藏了，快出来吧，大家都很想你呢”"}
{"time": 1756361786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709569778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1756362326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568597247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=306837084]仿佛是为了回应你一样，西里斯从门外推开门进了屋，\"嗯...诺诺怎么站在门口?\"皱起眉"}
{"time": 1756362385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421327505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呐，西莉斯姐姐你回来了啊，不过你怎么看起来没什么事的样子啊.....”"}
{"time": 1756362405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958578195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家都走了呢，西莉斯姐姐要跟上来吗”"}
{"time": 1756362419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024639022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "微笑着对她说"}
{"time": 1756362481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256793034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父，要带上西莉斯姐姐吗?哎？对不起...我会尊重她的意愿的，师父你别生气....”"}
{"time": 1756362503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332047246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会好好听话的....”"}
{"time": 1756362600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159975938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她看着你，眉头没松开，\"呃...在说什么奇怪的话?\"她身上的衣服和早上没什么区别，洋裙和小披肩干干净净，就连丝袜也没沾上什么尘埃"}
{"time": 1756362661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307702940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，西莉斯姐姐不知道吗...”仍然笑着看着她“大家..都死了呢”"}
{"time": 1756362803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522399764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1307702940]她推开你，\"这不是好好的吗？你在说什么?\""}
{"time": 1756362834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46283792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回头看看"}
{"time": 1756362866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363314325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"疯疯癫癫的，不成体统，你今天不用吃晚饭了。\"她的话传到你耳边，你身后是空无一人，只有血迹的院子，打开的餐厅门...并排躺着尸体"}
{"time": 1756362897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079333675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看她身上有没有那个发箍"}
{"time": 1756363046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236776195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家都好好的吗.....大家当然好好的啊，我感觉到了大家的温度在我身上，虽然冰冰的，但有大家陪伴的感觉让我的心暖暖的，呐西莉斯姐姐，你真的不来陪大家吗”"}
{"time": 1756363072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501097307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“罢了....有师父和露露，我已经足够了”"}
{"time": 1756363151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764986770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有)"}
{"time": 1756363192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472447230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯师父...我会尊重别人的想法的，那好像就这样了吧...阿尔贝尔大叔不知道什么时候才回来，我已经等了很久了，我不想在等了”"}
{"time": 1756363256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73474304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“再见了，西莉斯姐姐.....西莉斯姐姐人也很好呢，你要好好活下去啊”"}
{"time": 1756363291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805724796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回到餐厅内露露和莉夏的中间"}
{"time": 1756363730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609412739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你在干嘛?\"她拽住你的手，\"...不行，你现在跟我去学院\""}
{"time": 1756363906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397406798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要.....我要和师父还有露露一起...”"}
{"time": 1756363941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52568996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这就是我最后的愿望了......我才不要被他们扔下的”"}
{"time": 1756363963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176303390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她没有理会你，拽着你出门，黄昏时的天气阴沉，今天不见太阳，街道上没多少人。"}
{"time": 1756363980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556532889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你干嘛啊...你疯了吗，西莉斯姐姐”"}
{"time": 1756364044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757222632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你才是疯了吧？\"她看了一眼门里，抓着你就出门"}
{"time": 1756364049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301679909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“报仇什么的我也不想了......能和大家死在一起我就很满意了”"}
{"time": 1756364085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383537630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你看不见我浑身的血吗，西莉斯姐姐”"}
{"time": 1756364261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741185660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊..是，那又怎么样？”她抓得很紧，你被她带出了门"}
{"time": 1756364300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114572887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你明明能看见，那你为什么不相信大家已经死了，要不血从哪来的.........”"}
{"time": 1756364314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717991871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不会根本不是西莉斯姐姐吧...放开我”挣扎"}
{"time": 1756364467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640320855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”她懒得再回你，这是抓着你往前走，“别吵。”"}
{"time": 1756364525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606863983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么...我保护不了大家，也不能帮大家报仇...就连和大家一起死都做不到吗.....”"}
{"time": 1756364573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39970705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我真是个废人....”放弃了挣扎，任由西莉斯带着"}
{"time": 1756364606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611253222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“如果她们都死了，那现在就只剩我了，你能理解吗？那就跟着我。”"}
{"time": 1756364698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67418264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉斯姐姐觉得孤独的话，可以来陪我一起走......”"}
{"time": 1756364852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861624324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=67418264]“...哈？”她琥珀色的眸子看向你，你感觉有些鄙夷"}
{"time": 1756364895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896483820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过师父跟我说了...要尊重你的想法，你不想的话，我不会强迫你的..”"}
{"time": 1756364950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695034592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1067111252]*抬头看看图书馆里还有没有其他人？没有的话就说“打扰了……看起来，除我以外，应该是没有的”"}
{"time": 1756365285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143127303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=695034592]怀中的沙漏引人注目，此刻上面的沙子几乎全部要漏下来，她打了个哈欠，被兜帽遮住的耳朵动了动，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1756365557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456638520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1143127303]*保持沉默，不声不响地把匕首收回袖子里。随后……就当只是来这里避雨，静观其变了"}
{"time": 1756365723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106637109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=456638520]一时之间她也没有说话。\n直到...‘你’的声音打破了沉默，\"希古娜?哟...你还在这抱着那玩意?\""}
{"time": 1756366480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347974712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……刚刚怎么不见你发声……算了，那个沙漏，是什么？”"}
{"time": 1756368305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231728427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（都睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1756368354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037847360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756371630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808162411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756372320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276073758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打了把末日人机）"}
{"time": 1756372348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702114576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后？）"}
{"time": 1756372350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878231488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（伊神呢）"}
{"time": 1756372363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10296621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道）"}
{"time": 1756373121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803649780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=896483820]\"莉夏有没有说过要听大人的话?\"她瞪了你一眼，手上用力，力气大到你的手腕肉眼可见的红了一片，相当疼。"}
{"time": 1756373134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488584460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（醒了？）"}
{"time": 1756373366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830331784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=347974712]\"哼...\"心中冷哼一声，\"字面意思。\"\n对面的女孩看了看你的左眼，\"回来了?\""}
{"time": 1756373463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269002095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好好吧....既然你说大家没死，我就相信你一次...”"}
{"time": 1756373580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477363146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*轻轻开口“嗯，回来一趟。都有点记不清上一次来是什么时候了”"}
{"time": 1756373760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916551337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1269002095]之前就发生过记忆被篡改的事情..也许刚刚的事情也是假的呢，哪怕有万分之一的可能.....其实大家都没死...就算只有一丁点可能"}
{"time": 1756373886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139388244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果你骗我的话...我就不会管你的意愿了...”"}
{"time": 1756374194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694436354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1477363146]\"...你倒是学会装模作样了。\"她在你心里开口，\"不过...\"\n像是要映照她的话，\"不是你...希古娜没有在和你说话。\""}
{"time": 1756374290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797874614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*有点郁闷“算了，你们自己聊”"}
{"time": 1756374383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853054014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2139388244]“不...她们可能确实已经死去了。”她回头看着你，“我如此确信这件事。”"}
{"time": 1756374406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490658022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“骗人....你刚刚明明说大家没死“"}
{"time": 1756374420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323382872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她没说（））"}
