{"time": 1756374512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933328987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她的意思不会是她好好的吧....）"}
{"time": 1756374515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123452202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=797874614]\"倒也没什么好聊的。\"‘你’开口，\"我是为了承诺回来，现在到了这个时候了吧？\"‘你’看着那个沙漏里最后剩下的一点蓝砂。\n\"嗯...你有自己的事要做。\"对方的耳朵动了动，\"不过确实...没有要聊什么的事情...\""}
{"time": 1756374536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920443678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果大家都死了....我为什么还要活着.....”"}
{"time": 1756374558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189668635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“复仇是为了告别过去，但我已经没有未来了.........”"}
{"time": 1756374801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874173207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1123452202]“综上所述，有什么想问的，你自己问咯。”‘你’打了个哈欠，“希古娜，就这样吧。”她沉寂了下去"}
{"time": 1756374846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12525022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我已经什么都没有了....”跪倒在地"}
{"time": 1756374861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853040311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=189668635]“活着的人有活着的人要做的事情，无法跨越就不能面向未来。”她皱着眉，把你拉起来，面色比你冷静得多，“这是活着的人必须要经历的事。”"}
{"time": 1756374902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470430286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了...西莉丝姐姐 你离我远点吧，和我亲近的人都会遭受到不幸”"}
{"time": 1756374937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742296408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你是个好人，留我一个人自生自灭好了....”"}
{"time": 1756375097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283685526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=742296408]\"....\"她的眉头越皱越深，片刻之后眉头松开，一巴掌打在你的脸上，响亮的啪的一声，由于你被她拉着，只是打了个趔趄，\"你知道你在说什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1756375145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073855749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是先复仇？）"}
{"time": 1756375188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141470366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.......其他人都死了..只有我还活着，这还不能说明什么吗...大家会死可能都是因为我....”"}
{"time": 1756375220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19008933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=189668635]（关于复仇的问题）"}
