{"time": 1756399885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385829584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不会把卡珊德拉摇过来了吧）"}
{"time": 1756399898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229099863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你是菜鸡说是（）"}
{"time": 1756399989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329266329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1717906952]\"...第一个?或许吧...\"她低着脑袋，\"不过...涉及私人隐私...希古娜不会说，维拉也不会同意。\""}
{"time": 1756400018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237458949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1955490417]甚至天空还比外面多下着一层小雨，淅淅沥沥的"}
{"time": 1756400057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577799778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么会...为什么会这么安静....”"}
{"time": 1756400073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74932828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有人吗，快去救救西莉丝姐姐，有人吗”"}
{"time": 1756400137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341561173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1329266329]“好吧”*想了想“她脾气怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1756400292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697247275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“随便谁都好...有人吗..谁来帮帮我”"}
{"time": 1756400315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209432960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=341561173]\"你和她相处这么久?为什么要问我...?\"她抬起头看着你，\"你不是最清楚吗？\""}
{"time": 1756400344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121371497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1697247275]雨幕之中，你瞥见一个打伞的人影，越走越近"}
{"time": 1756400417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745125782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=209432960]“嗯……我不确定，那是秉性，还是表象”"}
{"time": 1756400424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545550467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以帮帮我吗...西莉丝姐姐和鲁鲁纳伊打起来了，可以去救救西莉丝姐姐吗”"}
{"time": 1756400432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833980394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跑到那个打伞的人身前"}
{"time": 1756400682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497218789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=745125782]\"有什么关系呢？\"她远远的看着你，目光里没有什么特别的含义，\"我了解的她和你认识的她，也不一定会是一个人。毕竟，相当之久了...\""}
{"time": 1756400912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789277807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“请您告诉我吧，哪怕是过时的消息”*闭上左眼“我也想知道”"}
{"time": 1756401004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204505663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1833980394]黑头发扎着两个发束的灰瞳女生，穿着一身和服，披着羽织，和你不同，她倒是完全不急，\"...你是?\""}
{"time": 1756401082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=789277807]\"古灵精怪?同时也言出必行，只是...\"叹了口气，她开口说完，\"这已经是第二个问题了，没有第三个。\""}
{"time": 1756401085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277971627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是一个性命微不足道的家伙，但是西莉丝姐姐是雷维翁骑士团的参谋...如果您有能力的话，求求你帮帮她.......”"}
{"time": 1756401106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513188971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要你能帮她，让我做什么都可以”"}
{"time": 1756401255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313594189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"请回吧...你不属于这里。\"雨水落在你的身后，衣服被打湿，寒冷刺骨，她没有看你，撑着伞准备越过你离开"}
{"time": 1756401280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258026029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1418348]“嗯，我明白”*点点头“我可以在这里避会雨吗？”"}
{"time": 1756401326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779145573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要走...求求你了”跪在地上抬头看着她“那你至少可以告诉我...其他人在哪吗”"}
{"time": 1756401498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684678665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=258026029]\"哦...原来在你眼中...还在下雨吗？\"她看着门外，\"要不要...试着上浮呢？就像...在水里一样。\""}
{"time": 1756401669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765816212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……？”*有些不理解，但是不妨碍照做。深吸一口气"}
{"time": 1756401692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726282630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=779145573]\"这里...?\"她低头看着你，\"也许在身后...?\"随后她摇摇头，\"离开这里吧。\""}
{"time": 1756401740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173073890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“身后？”回头看一眼"}
{"time": 1756401840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148915570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=173073890]一扇门突兀地出现在雨中，\"....\"她撑着伞继续往前，\"请回，勿扰公主安眠。\""}
{"time": 1756401866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792821180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢.....”冲进那扇门里"}
{"time": 1756401943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082621066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=765816212]就像是在水中憋气了很久的人突然钻出水面，你不由得急促地大口呼吸...雨幕和希古娜从你旁边消失不见..."}
{"time": 1756402214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417343436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1792821180]冲入门扉，如同陷入漆黑的漩涡。过个意志"}
