{"time": 1756402255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573333375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“噗……咕咳……”*捂着嘴，溺水般呛了几口“什么情……”"}
{"time": 1756402257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779642810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "经过了一连翻的精神冲击，感觉脑袋已经快要坏掉了"}
{"time": 1756402307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565229134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573333375]你发现...自己站在一个漆黑的房间中"}
