{"time": 1756402338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253070490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（亚哒...那西莉丝不就要死了）"}
{"time": 1756402375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580482053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“救救..西莉丝姐姐...救救她....”在意识消散前不断的重复这句话"}
{"time": 1756402463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117286584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1580482053]你看见...银发异色瞳的艾络温站在你的面前大口呼吸...有些状况外的样子，然后你...晕了过去"}
{"time": 1756402491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160811880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565229134]“……这是你的房间吗？卡珊德拉？”*看看能不能把火苗吐出来"}
{"time": 1756402494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889828984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565229134]面前趴着今天扬言要杀你的小女孩，嘴里喃喃着“救救..西莉丝姐姐...救救她....”"}
{"time": 1756402505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084274987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1756402516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464462214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是一片漆黑吗）"}
{"time": 1756402516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29687059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老天对我的惩罚吗...”怀着这样的意识彻底晕了过去"}
{"time": 1756402593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779549851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(微光吧)"}
{"time": 1756402675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731295378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“西利斯？那个参谋？”*记起来了名字，和那根指挥棒“不是，为什么你会在这？”"}
{"time": 1756402746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015340661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她已经晕了过去，衣服上看上去除了些污垢什么都没有，不过你感觉的脚底的触感十分粘稠"}
