{"time": 1756407693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787742990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太好了....”长舒一口气"}
{"time": 1756407831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513430546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "内环漆黑一片，除了法师塔那边亮着成片的灯光，大部分地方都已经熄了灯。弦月高悬于空，万籁俱寂。"}
{"time": 1756407887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42703039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好安静……敌人在哪？”*压低声音“……但内环也不安全”"}
{"time": 1756407922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723286981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下来我们去哪...学院吗”"}
