{"time": 1756408110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242527619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我之前有锻炼过的，这对于我挺轻松的”声音很平淡，没有夹杂着一点感情"}
{"time": 1756408131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242387522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你知道阿丽娅在哪吗”"}
