{"time": 1756457110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441929146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找一个巡夜人，急切的问问“大叔，你知道哪里有好的祈祷师吗”"}
