{"time": 1756460228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289648542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1144673270][CQ:image,file={D04761A7-6327-C486-0293-27EA2C15EF35}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-D04761A76327C486029327EA2C15EF35/0,file_size=167294]“我不是埃忒尔啦..”她的声音清脆，手里捏着两个铃铛，头顶着明晃晃的光圈，“人家只是一个普通的报时天使...埃忒尔让我来帮着守门，呜呜....”有些委屈"}
{"time": 1756460275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184657201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我问的是伊瑟尔（））"}
{"time": 1756460327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599885608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的，被翔哥影响了)"}
{"time": 1756460340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013099481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(总之你替换一下，埃忒尔换成伊瑟尔)"}
{"time": 1756460398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602338895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“报时……天使里还有这种分类么……算了，那不重要”*摇摇头“你能联系得上伊瑟尔阁下么？”"}
{"time": 1756460480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369593705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=895300188]\"...\"他看了一眼西里斯的情况，\"啧...真麻烦，我跟你一起去城门，可以拜托天使阁下。\""}
{"time": 1756460511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824669393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"谢谢你..谢谢你...\"跟着他"}
{"time": 1756460719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098767971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=602338895]\"诶...可是伊瑟尔只说让我守门，要干嘛啦?\"她看向你，目光纯真"}
{"time": 1756460851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277198916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“城里已经进了坏人啦”*总感觉她有些……天真，换上哄小孩一般的语气“应该不是你这边漏进来的，毕竟连内城都受了影响，不过还是让伊瑟尔阁下知道比较好？”"}
{"time": 1756460883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614146691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“已经有人被诅咒了”"}
{"time": 1756461055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923962282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1824669393]你跟着他走进城门，看见伊芙已经在这里和那个天使交谈起来，天使看上去懵懵懂懂的"}
{"time": 1756461117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812317134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "冲到天使身边“天使姐姐，快救救西莉斯姐姐”"}
{"time": 1756461300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "686576204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1277198916]\"诶...\"她正准备说什么，被冲出来的诺维拉打断，\"什么什么...又怎么啦?"}
{"time": 1756461323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744134378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我姐姐被诅咒了，你快救救她”"}
{"time": 1756461409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248105069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……不止”*耸了耸肩“伤口我处理过，但是也不能放着不管”"}
{"time": 1756461572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396120994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...诶...\"她被你们说得有点晕乎乎的，小脑袋一直在摇晃，\"别...别...好晕"}
{"time": 1756461588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595259439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "巡夜人站在身后不远，默不作声"}
{"time": 1756461630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920808325", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“求求你了，快帮她看看，天使姐姐”把西莉斯姐姐从背上放下，然后背起来"}
{"time": 1756461718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117437178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……一个个来吧”*反正看起来，一时半会就算有事也出不到自己头上。至于伊瑟尔……总感觉联系到了也不太管事，索性退到一边“先看看这位参谋小姐吧”"}
{"time": 1756461783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639400462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=920808325](什么叫放下，然后背起来)"}
{"time": 1756461792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723864967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(什么叫放下，然后背起来)"}
{"time": 1756461804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052835104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“求求你了，快帮她看看，天使姐姐”把西莉斯姐姐从背上放下，然后抱起来"}
{"time": 1756461804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938971022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我猜他想说抱起来）"}
{"time": 1756462186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618671570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2052835104]“好吧好吧。”她放下手里的铃铛俯下身来，两只手握住西里斯的手，“嗯...好漆黑...冰冷...这是什么...”她的身体有点抖，你看见有粘稠的黑色液体从西里斯手里的窟窿中滴落，带着不祥的黑气"}
{"time": 1756462246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960031680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我上次见到西莉丝姐姐，她在和鲁鲁纳伊交战..在见到就是这样了”"}
{"time": 1756462591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084323975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1960031680]“鲁鲁纳伊？”她手抖了抖，“不是...不是这个样子”"}
{"time": 1756462767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654749220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天使姐姐有办法吗...”"}
{"time": 1756462843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593410492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这不是那种家伙能干出的事情...”皱着眉，“我已经在努力啦...别催别催”"}
{"time": 1756462870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367174858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起”乖乖闭嘴"}
{"time": 1756462891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546232219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*找个帕子喷好催眠药物，她再开口就给她蒙上"}
{"time": 1756463126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473642789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眼前的天使始终皱着眉，你们注意到她的光环越发黯淡，滴下的漆黑如油墨的液体倒是越来越多"}
{"time": 1756463221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067771588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "焦急的等待"}
{"time": 1756463303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987752568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "等到这位天使头顶的光圈几乎再也看不见的时候，她才松开手，有些脱力地站在一旁，“差不多...”西里斯的脸色好了不少，手上的窟窿也变成了正常的血色"}
{"time": 1756463391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040343472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*拿出恢复精力的简单药物递给她“恢复体力的。辛苦了。还撑得住吗？”"}
{"time": 1756463399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152850103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢天使姐姐，谢谢...”看到西莉丝姐姐有所好转，如释重负，朝她跪下，然后给她磕一个头"}
{"time": 1756463577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540708266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1040343472]“呼呼...没事没事。”她没接过你的药，“我还撑得住的，哼哼，我可是天使...”似乎是为了补充，她小声，“这些药对我影响...”"}
{"time": 1756463680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409717968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧”*收回来，想了想，转手放到西里斯手边“我还是建议上报伊瑟尔阁下”"}
{"time": 1756463912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891108620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1152850103]“诶...这是我应该做的...”她慌慌张张扶起你，“嗯...伊瑟尔大人会知道这里的事情的...有关...莎木纳克雅入侵一事..”"}
{"time": 1756464018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634406964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“雷维翁骑士团的大家...除了西莉丝姐姐和阿尔贝尔大叔..大家都死了....”"}
{"time": 1756464038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539837076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没听过的名字”*摇摇头“算了，哪怕知道能力，我也没什么办法。不过……”*肚子叫起来“现在还有哪有东西吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1756464264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391093418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634406964]“外环...？”她皱着眉，“诶诶...好像不在人家管辖范围内诶...”她指了指城门，“去找那边的人吧？我记得...有位妖精公主还有一个剑客在那边。”"}
{"time": 1756464321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747164435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢天使姐姐.....”背起西莉丝姐姐朝那边慢慢过去"}
{"time": 1756464556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217010076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总不会我吃饭也在那边？）"}
{"time": 1756464602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129202319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539837076]一直默不作声的守夜人在你身后开口，“别急着走，小姑娘...我们还有事情要做。”他说完跟着回了伊芙的话，“吃饭的话也请跟我来，小姐也脱不开干系。”话语是命令的语气，没有商量的意思"}
{"time": 1756464689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708416285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天使姐姐，你可以帮我照顾一会西莉丝姐姐吗...”"}
{"time": 1756464694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756934175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我马上就回来”"}
{"time": 1756464747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317226663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我？”*有些疲惫，不过还是点点头“行吧，早点解决对大家都好”"}
{"time": 1756464777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530583669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“以及……我没下毒”*说完就先跟上守夜人"}
{"time": 1756464909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557932885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=708416285]“呃...交给我吗？”她看了看身后的城门，“我这里也算不上很安全吧...”"}
{"time": 1756465145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487866450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm..好吧，那也谢谢天使姐姐了，走吧，守夜人大叔”"}
{"time": 1756465656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622578618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（所以你带没带西里斯一起）"}
{"time": 1756465701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158376480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "继续背着西莉斯姐姐，既然有吃饭的地方，那应该也有可以休息的地方..."}
{"time": 1756465855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162751234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们跟着守夜人，一路到了一个两层的建筑，没有标识，位于法师塔之间，显得有些矮小，他推开门，“进去吧”"}
{"time": 1756465893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117383395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”乖乖进去"}
{"time": 1756465942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372784633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1756465997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993082141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "室内点着两盏小灯，有一个人坐在里面的椅子上，见你们进来，也没有理会你们，只是埋头清点着桌上的资料。[CQ:image,file={711F99A1-AFD6-BD18-53FE-1CC8E6273FA7}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-711F99A1AFD6BD1853FE1CC8E6273FA7/0,file_size=150598]"}
{"time": 1756466025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601980889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“尤里乌斯阁下。”带你们进来的人点点头算是示意，然后把你们带到了旁边的一个房间，“没吃饭？”"}
{"time": 1756466057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768977674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“的确，应该已经有……36个小时了”"}
{"time": 1756466058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041755472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这个房间更加窄小一些，只有一张桌子两张椅子，墙面上摆着一些镣铐，氛围上让你们觉得像是审讯室"}
{"time": 1756466216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582500518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“无所谓了，反正我也是将死之人了...”"}
{"time": 1756466234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916853151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以让西莉斯姐姐去好好休息吗”"}
{"time": 1756466275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473890836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*在他们交谈的时候闭目养神"}
{"time": 1756466283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796181711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对你的说辞他不置可否，\"我带她去床，你们先在这坐着\""}
{"time": 1756466296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954583003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”"}
{"time": 1756466335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433476708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*并不好奇发生了什么。反正她闭嘴总是好的"}
{"time": 1756466611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179030881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等着来审问吧...审完自己最后的价值应该也没有了，可以安心去找露露和师父了，还有爸妈..."}
{"time": 1756466639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607038701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他把西里斯带走，过了一会端着两份晚餐过来，简单的冷面包热牛奶，"}
{"time": 1756466675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049011486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把自己的那份都移到艾洛温面前"}
{"time": 1756466751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607399678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢”*倒是毫不客气，不紧不慢但毫不停歇地吃起来"}
{"time": 1756466847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648043953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃好了再喊我)"}
{"time": 1756466879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029061238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有什么要问的就先问我吧....”"}
{"time": 1756466912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871203675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（吃好了再喊是……）"}
{"time": 1756467019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754738952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快点问完，快点放我走.....”"}
{"time": 1756467204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242491326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*吃完一份，暂且停下“嗯，不如我们先谈事？”"}
{"time": 1756467358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514064345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不着急。\"他看了看诺维拉的样子，\"这小丫头倒是很急，但我不急。\""}
{"time": 1756467426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438055456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露，别急，等我回答完这个叔叔的问题，我就来了”小声嘀咕"}
{"time": 1756467513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659695173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“都行”既然他这么说，那就接着吃第二份。吃到后面多少有点噎，不过身体亟待补充能量"}
{"time": 1756467648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62167551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总算把餐食都塞完，吃得有些恍惚“……呃……谢谢”"}
{"time": 1756467731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852870598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "脸色惨白，但露出生硬的笑容，继续小声嘀咕“好了，露露，别开我玩笑了，迟到了一小会不要紧的..师父不也没说什么...”"}
{"time": 1756467783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936516505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这家伙嘀哩咕噜说什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1756467977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632858618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了好了..不要催我了....”抬起头看向守夜人“还不能开始吗？”"}
{"time": 1756468019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673923861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我朋友有点着急..我已经让她等我两三个小时了......可以快点吗，先生”"}
{"time": 1756468163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758950277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"先说说看，你们两个出现在收敛之庭的原因吧。\"他看了看你们，手里捏着一个纸条"}
{"time": 1756468212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396020484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "补充一下立绘"}
{"time": 1756468213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272282335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={F54194B2-D290-EAE7-11C0-2ECAFF25724A}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-F54194B2D290EAE711C02ECAFF25724A/0,file_size=129756]"}
{"time": 1756468217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409409794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（帅得不谈）"}
{"time": 1756468245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352119131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道呢，我之前去学院一个人都没有，有个人说我走错地方了，给我开了一扇门，然后我就到那里了.....”"}
{"time": 1756468299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217661127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我么，从图书馆里往外走的时候，莫名就进入了某种……环境？到处都下着雨”"}
{"time": 1756468311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789070599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（幻境）"}
{"time": 1756468321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411917452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“醒来之后，就在那里面了”"}
{"time": 1756468406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029076386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我到的应该早些，但也没看出来她怎么出现的”"}
{"time": 1756468583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895135576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”她皱了皱眉，“你是觉得我会信你们？”"}
{"time": 1756468586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532986697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（他）"}
{"time": 1756468626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355653104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...就是这样啦，你不相信我也没什么办法”小熊摊手.jpg"}
{"time": 1756468684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796375586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“测谎的办法，学院应该有的是吧”*摊手“随意使用，我没说谎”"}
{"time": 1756468903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451396358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我换个问题，为什么你那个时候要去学院，而你们又在学院里做了什么？\""}
{"time": 1756468996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768488685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"西莉斯姐姐和鲁鲁纳伊打了起来，她给了我一个金色的徽章，让我往学院跑\"找找那个徽章"}
{"time": 1756469020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88687781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“密会延期了，学院没有给我安排住处，我便在校内闲逛。参观了几个地点，最后去了图书馆，借阅了些炼金方面的书籍”"}
{"time": 1756469140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163816553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E8E1A617960B93EAAE9408F112A0477F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSvelwt8soeyow0LT1clOSF494z_RjLywkg_woo68fruP2vjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQTk1gbw-dvj4SZ7MBZN_k2XoCGLo&amp;rkey=CAESMHVIuk0H-P1J7bCd9z-5e9m3JglK0k85LFg4v-rje2c_alEN6i4F6VbebBZ1KAzgWw,file_size=157131]"}
{"time": 1756469141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343156797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...鲁鲁纳伊?\"他看着你，\"你没有听天使说吗？她，不是跟鲁鲁纳伊交手。\"确认了徽章，\"原来是她...\""}
{"time": 1756469150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583177074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（《嘻嘻》）"}
{"time": 1756469168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396220450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1756469185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871893810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许西莉丝姐姐后来又遇到了其他人呢... 我只是一个逃兵啦”"}
{"time": 1756469207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627139847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88687781]\"...至于你，假设你现在说得是对的，那...你是怎么跌入幻境，在其中又发生了什么?\""}
{"time": 1756469312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82539858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从图书馆借阅完之后，我就打算去炼金室实践一下。出了图书馆，发现天在下雨……一开始我没在意，但我发现那片雨我走不出去”"}
{"time": 1756469355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654695462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后来……在雨幕中，碰到了一个人，打着伞，看不清样子，她让我回图书馆”"}
{"time": 1756469371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554518563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我走不到别的地方，但偏偏回得去”"}
{"time": 1756469398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927725357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也遇到了一个打伞的人，她说让我不要打扰公主安眠”"}
{"time": 1756469501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846092935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“回到了图书馆，里头只有一个抱着沙漏的人。她让我……浮起来”"}
{"time": 1756469513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370684658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我照做了，就到那里了”"}
{"time": 1756469588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136190174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，好了吗，大叔....”"}
{"time": 1756469934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157466826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"他沉默了下来，过了一会扭头看向另一侧的墙面，\"你怎么看，头儿。\n墙面传出回音，\"没有在撒谎，不过...还有隐瞒。\"紧接着墙面扭开一个一人高的门，一个白发穿着宽大制服的男人走了出来。"}
{"time": 1756469961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793613278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=7F7BDBAEB6699A86C534EF556B475DAA.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRRILo4gdF8mWvIhVFD9kMWkfqrcRiunwUg_woo-8WcwICwjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQK2xjRhUUHRR6Sra4IxXA3XoCUbw&amp;rkey=CAESMHVIuk0H-P1J7bCd9z-5e9m3JglK0k85LFg4v-rje2c_alEN6i4F6VbebBZ1KAzgWw,file_size=85934]"}
{"time": 1756470021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196632805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我知道的都说啦...”"}
{"time": 1756470105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210484440", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然”*很大方地承认了“但我保证我隐瞒的部分与学院无关”"}
{"time": 1756470144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828163840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他接替了之前男人的位置，坐下来，看着诺维拉，\"你遭遇了什么?在外环。\"\n紧接着看向伊芙，\"你在图书馆，应该不止有这点事吧？我们既然是维持秩序之人，希望你也能如实报知。\""}
{"time": 1756470173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032103934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然”*很大方地承认了“但我保证我隐瞒的部分与学院无关”"}
{"time": 1756470302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848641698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“具体发生了什么，我想阁下可以直接问维拉……我不是很想说”"}
{"time": 1756470325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156115651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...是么？\"他盯着你的左眼，让你感觉有些发毛，\"现在又换了个皮囊么？\"冷笑了一声，\"真理的...\"\n\"住嘴！\"‘你’突然开口，把你自己都吓了一跳。"}
{"time": 1756470375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487176848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……不只是皮囊，我想”"}
{"time": 1756470398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072914989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“外环...先是露露，然后是蜜姆姐姐，杰诺大叔，璐涅丝姐姐，莉夏师父，奈落姐姐，还有玛姆姐姐，大家都被人杀了呢....”一想到这些事，感觉脑子逐渐又失去了思考能力“大家都死了...把我一个人，oh还有西莉斯姐姐，留了下来...”"}
{"time": 1756470418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117688792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大叔，你说她们是不是很狡猾，不过我很快就会去找她们的”"}
{"time": 1756470453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114030560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“师父之前救了我，我要一直粘着她，我之前还说要帮她养老呢”"}
{"time": 1756470537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783520691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你感觉身体被更强的力量掌控住，这种完全被压制的感觉还是第一次，‘你’在冷笑，\"宾森特，我敢确信，你要是再多一句嘴，你和这个屋子有一个会见不到明天的太阳。\"玛纳在整个房间内升腾，气氛一瞬降到冰点"}
{"time": 1756470551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401682902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "露出奇怪的满足的笑容"}
{"time": 1756470611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526605618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎呦，露露，我没有自恋了，实话实说就是了...”"}
{"time": 1756470615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022116207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "站在一边的守夜人的手按在腰间的配枪上，有蓝色的符文出现在空气中，名为宾森特的男人伸出手拦住他，一时之间没人注意诺维拉的情况"}
{"time": 1756470650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358199362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "短时间没人理自己，继续沉浸在美好的幻想中了"}
{"time": 1756470680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528702330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了，我能说两句吗”*皱了皱眉头"}
{"time": 1756470786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079270026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“首先，我想，图书馆里发生的事应该与那间屋子无关。除非两位能充分说明这之间的关联，否则我想我没有把我在图书馆里走了多少步也数出来”"}
{"time": 1756470833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920909331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看来我们这位不可爱的访客...\"他摇摇头，\"老夫也是太久没操练过了，不妨我们换个平和的方式说话吧。\"尽管他这么说，灰白色密密麻麻的符文却是严严整整出现在整个房间的内壁，双手交叠，压着脑袋审视着你"}
{"time": 1756470927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647009124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“其次，我作为受邀嘉宾，及受害人，阁下作为学院的守夜人……阁下是不是该先为失职检讨，再来讨论其他的事？”"}
{"time": 1756470947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304336743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2079270026]（没有必要把（）"}
{"time": 1756470971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927576399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还要等多久啊，大叔....我真的很赶时间啦“"}
{"time": 1756470990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442265073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2079270026]\"有趣...\"他突然笑了一下，灰白的符文撤去，随后像是对你失去兴趣了，他看向碎碎念的诺维拉，\"看来这位小姐病得也不轻，我为我的冷落道歉，不过...你也没什么值得赶时间的事吧？\""}
{"time": 1756470999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389529799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*毫不示弱，双眼一起盯着他"}
{"time": 1756471040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227349036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露和师父已经等了我快半天了呢，我们约好要一起出发的”"}
{"time": 1756471116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489615608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“万一她们等急了....”摇摇头“她们不会扔下我的，但我也不能让她们等太久，要不就不是乖孩子了....”"}
{"time": 1756471137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387304801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说着话，一个年轻的橙头发女孩，穿着制服推门进来，\"头儿！失礼啦。\"她小跑着把一份文件递到宾森特手里，随后对着一旁的巡夜人做了个wink，又小跑着出去了。"}
{"time": 1756471142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589081739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=362FA32654998D85A42D9F0A3BDE4B43.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQPYiy-nadVmp4QzJpPYkTUN70irBiwkAgg_woopI-e84SwjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQKcuyVHiBJGbQ1k5VXpsT2XoC6_M&amp;rkey=CAESMHVIuk0H-P1J7bCd9z-5e9m3JglK0k85LFg4v-rje2c_alEN6i4F6VbebBZ1KAzgWw,file_size=133168]"}
{"time": 1756471221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424824600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1489615608]\"今天是怎么了，遇到的怪胎真是有史以来最多。\"他没理你，看着女孩出去，低头看着手里的文件，\"依据本城的秩序，两位需要在这里被拘留三天...\""}
{"time": 1756471272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354783136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“三天吗....”看看之前从璐涅丝身上拔的匕首还在不在身上"}
{"time": 1756471294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490381140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不在"}
{"time": 1756471299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702115750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（依据秩序感觉怪怪的）"}
{"time": 1756471327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886160768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己的佩剑有没有被没收"}
{"time": 1756471353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382786261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不在身上"}
{"time": 1756471390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661366824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾洛温小姐，你的匕首可以借我用用吗”在她耳边小声的问到"}
{"time": 1756471414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388827626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你要当着审讯的面问这个?)"}
{"time": 1756471420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428475038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"原来还藏着匕首。\""}
{"time": 1756471425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122567251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我的精神已经不正常了）"}
{"time": 1756471431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386866413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问什么都不奇怪吧）"}
{"time": 1756471463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "469658122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你是打算自己交上来，还是我帮你?\"他看着伊芙，敲了敲桌子"}
{"time": 1756471476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992658605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（晚点）"}
{"time": 1756471510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697259777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(时间差不多咯)"}
{"time": 1756471539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887375311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*把匕首从袖口里拿出来放在桌上“到时候记得还给我”"}
{"time": 1756471558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008105437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？早知道在忍一会了，算了，本来还想着死的好看一点”站起来，头狠狠朝桌角磕过去"}
{"time": 1756471651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72074393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1697259777]（什么）[CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1756471998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429530845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1008105437]\"...\"你被突然出现的法阵箍住，一动不能动，\"真是麻烦的小孩，我说，麦哲，你和圣里奈以后可不能把孩子养成这个样子。\"\n被叫做麦哲的男人收起刀，脸有些微红，没回答"}
{"time": 1756472031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128277113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不过他看着刀的时候皱了皱眉，伊芙还是捕捉到了。"}
{"time": 1756472095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "117435985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……三天。我倒是好奇我违背了哪条秩序？”"}
{"time": 1756472146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2132303671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "帮大家报仇做不到，保护大家也做不到，就连陪大家一起死也做不到吗...留下了不甘的眼泪，在等三天，好吧，三天过后自由了..他们就管不到我了"}
{"time": 1756472195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977019573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本司不予受理质疑。\"他站起身，\"两位在这两天好好反省。\"看了看手里的文件，拿起来准备离开"}
{"time": 1756472269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587502425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“马纳利亚的守夜人，居然是这么不讲道理的组织么？”*皱起眉来"}
{"time": 1756472376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868623693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以把我们两个关一起吗...”"}
{"time": 1756472377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792291773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"从你带着危险分子出现在这里的时候，你就该做好打算。\"他的话语古井无波，皱眉看了看诺维拉，\"论怪胎，你们两个倒是般配。\""}
{"time": 1756472452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124913646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我要是真危险，就不会出现在这了”"}
{"time": 1756472545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938710673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868623693]“此外我拒绝”"}
{"time": 1756472597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435010380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她既然是危险分子，把我们关在一起也可以互相监督呢，对吧大叔”"}
{"time": 1756472621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236079398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哈哈)"}
{"time": 1756472626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694887764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(半夜互掐吗)"}
